# suite TSORETRN customer returns and
ok 1 - an unknown function is refused, not obeyed
ok 2 - a return without a customer is refused
ok 3 - a return must quote the original supply
ok 4 - a return line needs a quantity above zero
ok 5 - a return authorisation moves no stock
ok 6 - a return authorisation raises no credit
ok 7 - a return does not reopen the original order
ok 8 - ten days after delivery is inside the window
ok 9 - AUTHORISE still moves no stock
ok 10 - 45 days is outside the 30 day window
ok 11 - a late non-faulty return is reason RET0004
ok 12 - a late return is held for authority, not accepted
ok 13 - the 45 days are counted and reported
ok 14 - the non-faulty window is 30 days
ok 15 - a late return still moves no stock
ok 16 - faulty goods use the warranty period
ok 17 - the default warranty period is 12 months
ok 18 - a faulty return is marked as a warranty claim
ok 19 - outside warranty needs an approval
ok 20 - an approval turns the hold into a warning
ok 21 - a concession without an approval is refused
ok 22 - a refused concession still moves no stock
ok 23 - a concession needs a value or a percentage
ok 24 - a value-only concession has no stock effect
ok 25 - a concession never returns stock to the warehouse
ok 26 - a concession does not reopen the original order
1..26
# TSORETRN customer returns and passed 00026 failed 00000
# exit 0
